<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A category of expenditure within a budget, determining what the allocated money can be spent on, for example salaries, equipment, travel."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-budget a frapo:Budget ;\n        frapo:hasBudgetInformation :my-budgeted-amout .\n    \n    :my-budgeted-amount a frapo:BudgetedAmount ;\n        frapo:hasBudgetCategory frapo:facilities-costs .\n\n    frapo:facilities-costs a frapo:BudgetCategory .\n    " .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/FinancialEntity> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/BudgetCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "budget category"@en .
